  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘、お疲れ様",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6004003100020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……ごめん、だめやった～……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600400310/6004003100020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結果は確かに残念だったけど、\r\n恋鐘の成長ぶりには驚かされたよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そばで見てきた俺が言うんだ\r\n間違いないだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6004003100030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……うちも、前より上手くできたと\r\n思っとったけん……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600400310/6004003100030"
  },
  {
    "id": 6004003100040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "その分……なんでやったとかなって",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600400310/6004003100040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ああ、俺も悔しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘がこのステージに向けて\r\nすごく頑張ってたの、知ってるからさ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6004003100050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "…………うん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600400310/6004003100050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからこの次はさ、\r\n今よりもっと、成長した恋鐘で",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日の観客を\r\nあっと驚かせるようなステージをしよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6004003100060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……！\r\nそうやね……！　いかんいかん！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600400310/6004003100060"
  },
  {
    "id": 6004003100070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちのなりたかアイドルは、\r\nこがんとこで止まったりせんもん",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/600400310/6004003100070"
  },
  {
    "id": 6004003100080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "落ち込んでる暇があったら、\r\n練習練習ばい！",
